WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.960
It’s time for a clash of the titans: SCP-682, the&nbsp;
Hard to Destroy Reptile, SCP-106, the Old Man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:12.400
and SCP-953, the Polymorphic Humanoid.&nbsp;
This wasn’t even a Foundation cross-test:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.000
Just an organic battle that occurred&nbsp;
during a massive containment breach.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.720
SCP-953 and SCP-106 entered 682’s containment&nbsp;
chamber, at which point they all began staring at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:28.480
each other, preparing for an attack. 106 began the&nbsp;
battle, sinking into the floor and grabbing 953,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:32.240
trying to pull her into his pocket&nbsp;
dimension. She then grabbed 682,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:35.520
resulting in all three of them being&nbsp;
pulled into the pocket dimension.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:40.000
They all remained in there for five hours, before&nbsp;
returning, heavily injured from their fight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.600
106 returned to his chamber, 953 was recaptured by&nbsp;
Foundation personnel, and 682 regenerated its 67%&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.000
body mass loss. All three have refused&nbsp;
to speak about the incident since.

